\fs24 1. The biggest problem I faced during this project was the limited time frame on Udacity Cloud Labs. This is not necessarily an Azure cognitive resource specific problem, however it indirectly affects all the cognitive resources. Every time I paused working on the project, I was faced with this issue, which was solved by exporting the ARM template and deploying a custom template upon every session. Without figuring out this loophole I would have had to manually deploy each resource every time I wanted to start up a new session. The template.json and parameters.json were exported every time I exited and redeployed when I came back to work on it again. \
